+# F1.2 — Composable UI Addons & Navigation 3
+
+Date: 2026-11-14 · Base commit: `a316f53`
+
+## Scope delivered
+
+- `ui/navigation`, `ui/dashboard`, `ui/settings` as beta, generatable addons.
+- Navigation 3 1.2.1 with typed `AppRoute`, one `NavDisplay`, deterministic
+  initial destination and back handling.
+- Slot-based destination registration: imports, routes, entries.
+- Material 3 Dashboard and Settings screens using design tokens.
+- Web preview selector for Welcome/Dashboard/Settings.
+- Room + UI combination builds successfully.
+
+## Validation
+
+| Check | Result |
+| --- | --- |
+| `bun run typecheck` | PASS |
+| `bun test packages tests` | PASS: 89 tests, 550 assertions |
+| `bun run check:astro` | PASS |
+| `bun run templates:check` | PASS |
+| `bun run build` | PASS |
+| Navigation project `assembleDebug` | PASS |
+| Dashboard project `assembleDebug` + lint | PASS |
+| Settings project `assembleDebug` + lint | PASS |
+| Dashboard + Settings project | PASS |
+| Room + Dashboard + Settings | PASS (assemble + androidTest compile) |
+| Determinism (selection order) | PASS |
+
+## Known limitations
+
+- Instrumented UI tests compiled but not executed (no device/emulator).
+- Preview is a web approximation, not Compose.
+- UI addons remain beta pending runtime UI evidence.
+EOF
